@startuml
title Agentic AI Pipeline for Test Failure Analysis

actor Developer
participant "GitHub Actions" as CI
participant "AI Agent\n(MCP Client)" as Agent
participant "LLM\n(Claude Opus 5)" as LLM
participant "Codebeamer\nREST API" as CB

Developer -> CI: git push (Code Modified)
activate CI

CI -> CI: Build & Run Tests (Unit/SIL)
alt Test Failed or Coverage < 80%
    CI -> CI: Generate Failure Logs (XML/TXT)
    CI -> Agent: Trigger AI Analysis Script
    activate Agent

    Agent -> Agent: Read Failed Tests & Source Code
    Agent -> LLM: [Prompt] "Analyze this C code & GTest failure"
    activate LLM
    LLM --> Agent: Root Cause & Suggested Code Fix (JSON Schema)
    deactivate LLM

    Agent -> CB: POST /api/v3/items/{issue_id}/comments
    activate CB
    CB --> Agent: 201 Created
    deactivate CB

    Agent --> CI: AI Analysis Complete
    deactivate Agent
end

CI --> Developer: Pipeline Failed (with AI hints in CB)
deactivate CI
@enduml
